title: "EPI-LEAN: Epistemic Proof Intelligence for Lean"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
authors:
  - name: "Justo Tapiador"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >
  An open-source research framework for auditing the epistemic structure
  of formally verified mathematical proofs, focusing on semantic
  traceability, assumption provenance, and mathematical correspondence.